OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Ffine evening with plenty of late
OL,7,Fsunshine and a very low risk of a
OL,8,Flight shower over northern Devon and
OL,9,FCornwall. Overnight will remain dry
OL,10,Fwith clear spells, but feeling a
OL,11,Flittle warmer than recent nights.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FAnother fine and dry day with
OL,14,Fplenty of sunshine across the region,
OL,15,Falthough some patchy cloud likely
OL,16,Facross Cornwall. Feeling hot in the
OL,17,Fsunshine and light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
